\p \v 5 \w When|strong="H3588"\w* \w you sacrifice|strong="H2076"\w* \w a peace offering|strong="H8002"\w* \w to the LORD|strong="H3068"\w*, \w you shall offer it|strong="H2076"\w* \w for your acceptance|strong="H7522"\w*. \v 6 \w It shall be eaten|strong="H398"\w* \w on the day|strong="H3117"\w* \w you sacrifice it|strong="H2077"\w*, \w or on the next day|strong="H4283"\w*; \w but what remains|strong="H3498"\w* \w on the third|strong="H7992"\w* \w day|strong="H3117"\w* \w must be burned up|strong="H784"\w*. \v 7 \w If|strong="H518"\w* \w any of it is eaten|strong="H398"\w* \w on the third|strong="H7992"\w* \w day|strong="H3117"\w*, \w it|strong="H1931"\w* \w is tainted|strong="H6292"\w* \w and will not|strong="H3808"\w* \w be accepted|strong="H7521"\w*. \v 8 \w Whoever eats|strong="H398"\w* \w it will bear|strong="H5375"\w* \w his iniquity|strong="H5771"\w*, \w for|strong="H3588"\w* \w he has profaned|strong="H2490"\w* \w what is holy|strong="H6944"\w* \w to the LORD|strong="H3068"\w*. \w That|strong="H1931"\w* \w person|strong="H5315"\w* \w must be cut off|strong="H3772"\w* \w from his people|strong="H5971"\w*.
\s1 Love Your Neighbor
\r (\ref Romans 13:8–10|ROM 13:8-10\ref*)
\p \v 9 \w When you reap|strong="H7114"\w* \w the harvest|strong="H7105"\w* \w of your land|strong="H776"\w*, \w you are not|strong="H3808"\w* \w to reap|strong="H3615"\w* \w to the very edges|strong="H6285"\w* \w of your field|strong="H7704"\w* \w or gather|strong="H3950"\w* \w the gleanings|strong="H3951"\w* \w of your harvest|strong="H7105"\w*. \v 10 \w You must not|strong="H3808"\w* \w strip your vineyard|strong="H3754"\w* \w bare|strong="H5953"\w* \w or gather|strong="H3950"\w* \w its|strong="H3754"\w* \w fallen grapes|strong="H6528"\w*. \w Leave|strong="H5800"\w* \w them|strong="H853"\w* \w for the poor|strong="H6041"\w* \w and the foreigner|strong="H1616"\w*. \w I|strong="H589"\w* \w am the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w your God|strong="H430"\w*.
\p \v 11 \w You must not|strong="H3808"\w* \w steal|strong="H1589"\w*. \w You must not|strong="H3808"\w* \w lie|strong="H3584"\w* \w or deceive|strong="H8266"\w* \w one|strong="H376"\w* \w another|strong="H5997"\w*.
