\p \v 28 \w You must not|strong="H3808"\w* \w make any cuts|strong="H8296"\w* \w in your bodies|strong="H1320"\w* \w for the dead|strong="H5315"\w* \w or put|strong="H5414"\w* \w tattoo|strong="H7085"\w* \w marks|strong="H3793"\w* on yourselves. \w I|strong="H589"\w* \w am the LORD|strong="H3068"\w*.
\p \v 29 \w You must not|strong="H408"\w* \w defile|strong="H2490"\w* \w your daughter|strong="H1323"\w* \w by making her a prostitute|strong="H2181"\w*, \w or|strong="H3808"\w* \w the land|strong="H776"\w* \w will be prostituted|strong="H2181"\w* \w and filled|strong="H4390"\w* \w with depravity|strong="H2154"\w*.
