\p \v 9 \w If|strong="H3588"\w* \w anyone|strong="H376"\w* \w curses|strong="H7043"\w*\f + \fr 20:9 \ft Or \fqa dishonors \ft or \fqa reviles\ft ; similarly again in this verse\f* \w his father|strong="H1"\w* \w or mother|strong="H517"\w*, \w he must be put to death|strong="H4191"\w*.\f + \fr 20:9 \ft Cited in \ref Matthew 15:4|MAT 15:4\ref* and Mark 7:10\f* \w He has cursed|strong="H7043"\w* \w his father|strong="H1"\w* \w or mother|strong="H517"\w*; \w his blood|strong="H1818"\w* shall be upon him.
\s1 Punishments for Sexual Immorality
\r (\ref Proverbs 5:1–23|PRO 5:1-23\ref*; \ref 1 Corinthians 5:1–8|1CO 5:1-8\ref*)
\p \v 10 \w If a man|strong="H376"\w* \w commits adultery|strong="H5003"\w* \w with|strong="H853"\w* \w another man’s|strong="H376"\w* \w wife|strong="H802"\w*— \w with|strong="H853"\w* \w the wife|strong="H802"\w* \w of his neighbor|strong="H7453"\w*— \w both the adulterer|strong="H5003"\w* \w and the adulteress|strong="H5003"\w* \w must surely be put to death|strong="H4191"\w*.
\p \v 11 \w If a man|strong="H376"\w* \w lies|strong="H7901"\w* \w with|strong="H853"\w* \w his father’s|strong="H1"\w* \w wife|strong="H802"\w*, \w he has uncovered|strong="H1540"\w* \w his father’s|strong="H1"\w* \w nakedness|strong="H6172"\w*. \w Both|strong="H8147"\w* \w must surely be put to death|strong="H4191"\w*; \w their blood|strong="H1818"\w* is upon them.
