\p \v 18 \w If a man|strong="H376"\w* \w lies|strong="H7901"\w* \w with|strong="H853"\w* \w a menstruating|strong="H1739"\w* \w woman|strong="H802"\w* \w and has sexual relations with her|strong="H1540"\w*,\f + \fr 20:18 \ft Literally \fqa uncovers her nakedness\ft ; similarly in verse 19\f* \w he has exposed|strong="H6168"\w* \w the source of her flow|strong="H4726"\w*, \w and she|strong="H1931"\w* \w has uncovered|strong="H1540"\w* \w the source|strong="H4726"\w* \w of her blood|strong="H1818"\w*. \w Both|strong="H8147"\w* \w of them must be cut off|strong="H3772"\w* \w from among|strong="H7130"\w* \w their people|strong="H5971"\w*.
