\s1 Distinguish between Clean and Unclean
\p \v 22 \w You are therefore to keep|strong="H8104"\w* \w all|strong="H3605"\w* \w My statutes|strong="H2708"\w* \w and|strong="H3605"\w* \w ordinances|strong="H4941"\w*, \w so that the land|strong="H776"\w* \w where|strong="H834"\w* \w I|strong="H589"\w* \w am bringing|strong="H935"\w* \w you to live|strong="H3427"\w* \w will not|strong="H3808"\w* \w vomit you out|strong="H6958"\w*. \v 23 \w You must not|strong="H3808"\w* \w follow|strong="H1980"\w* \w the statutes|strong="H2708"\w* \w of the nations|strong="H1471"\w* \w I|strong="H589"\w* \w am driving out|strong="H7971"\w* \w before you|strong="H6440"\w*. \w Because|strong="H3588"\w* \w they did|strong="H6213"\w* \w all|strong="H3605"\w* \w these things|strong="H428"\w*, \w I abhorred|strong="H6973"\w* them.
\p \v 24 \w But I have told|strong="H559"\w* you \w that you|strong="H859"\w* \w will inherit|strong="H3423"\w* \w their land|strong="H127"\w*, \w since I|strong="H589"\w* \w will give|strong="H5414"\w* it to you \w as an inheritance|strong="H3423"\w* — \w a land|strong="H776"\w* \w flowing|strong="H2100"\w* \w with milk|strong="H2461"\w* \w and honey|strong="H1706"\w*. \w I|strong="H589"\w* \w am the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w your God|strong="H430"\w*, \w who|strong="H834"\w* \w has set you apart|strong="H914"\w* \w from|strong="H4480"\w* \w the peoples|strong="H5971"\w*.
\p \v 25 \w You are therefore to distinguish|strong="H914"\w* \w between|strong="H996"\w* \w clean|strong="H2889"\w* \w and unclean|strong="H2931"\w* \w animals|strong="H929"\w* \w and|strong="H996"\w* \w birds|strong="H5775"\w*. \w Do not|strong="H3808"\w* \w become contaminated|strong="H8262"\w* \w by any animal|strong="H929"\w* \w or bird|strong="H5775"\w*, \w or by anything|strong="H3605"\w* \w that|strong="H834"\w* \w crawls|strong="H7430"\w* \w on the ground|strong="H127"\w*; \w I have set these|strong="H834"\w* \w apart|strong="H914"\w* \w as unclean|strong="H2930"\w* for you. \v 26 \w You are to be|strong="H1961"\w* \w holy|strong="H6918"\w* to Me \w because|strong="H3588"\w* \w I|strong="H589"\w*, \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w*, \w am holy|strong="H6918"\w*, \w and I have set you apart|strong="H914"\w* \w from|strong="H4480"\w* \w the nations|strong="H5971"\w* \w to be|strong="H1961"\w* My own.
